{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"const assetPathPrefix = \"https://www.figma.com/api/mcp/asset/7277a62d-f16e-4593-a1b1-d2ca734ad7c9\";\nconst img = `${assetPathPrefix}/83ac5.svg`;\nconst img1 = `${assetPathPrefix}/c4e1e.svg`;\nconst img2 = `${assetPathPrefix}/a5de6.svg`;\nconst imgSubtract = `${assetPathPrefix}/aa689.svg`;\n\nfunction NavStores({ className }: { className?: string }) {\n  return (\n    <div className={className || \"bg-white h-[60px] relative w-[390px]\"} data-node-id=\"336:783\" data-name=\"САДОХОД / nav / stores\">\n      <div className=\"absolute left-[52.5px] size-[27px] top-[16.5px]\" data-node-id=\"336:784\" data-name=\"Магазины\">\n        <img alt=\"\" className=\"absolute block inset-0 max-w-none size-full\" src={img} />\n      </div>\n      <div className=\"absolute left-[169.5px] size-[27px] top-[16.5px]\" data-node-id=\"336:789\" data-name=\"Камера\">\n        <img alt=\"\" className=\"absolute block inset-0 max-w-none size-full\" src={img1} />\n      </div>\n      <div className=\"absolute left-[286.5px] size-[27px] top-[16.5px]\" data-node-id=\"336:792\" data-name=\"Профиль\">\n        <img alt=\"\" className=\"absolute block inset-0 max-w-none size-full\" src={img2} />\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n\nexport default function Component14() {\n  return (\n    <div className=\"bg-[#f0efeb] relative size-full\" data-node-id=\"366:16552\" data-name=\"14 · Адрес не найден\">\n      <div className=\"-translate-x-1/2 absolute h-[100px] left-[calc(50%-0.21px)] top-0 w-[397.572px]\" data-node-id=\"366:16565\" data-name=\"Subtract\">\n        <img alt=\"\" className=\"absolute block inset-0 max-w-none size-full\" src={imgSubtract} />\n      </div>\n      <p className=\"-translate-x-1/2 [word-break:break-word] absolute font-['Helvetica:Bold'] leading-[normal] left-1/2 not-italic text-[16px] text-black text-center top-[67px] w-[330px]\" data-node-id=\"366:16570\">\n        адрес не найден\n      </p>\n      <div className=\"absolute contents left-[30px] top-[141px]\" data-node-id=\"366:16571\">\n        <div className=\"absolute bg-white h-[60px] left-[30px] rounded-[5px] top-[141px] w-[330px]\" data-node-id=\"366:16572\" />\n        <p className=\"[word-break:break-word] absolute font-['Helvetica:Regular'] leading-[normal] left-[50px] not-italic text-[#a5a5a5] text-[12px] top-[149px] whitespace-nowrap\" data-node-id=\"366:16573\">\n          указать адрес\n        </p>\n      </div>\n      <a className=\"absolute contents cursor-pointer left-[30px] top-[585px]\" data-node-id=\"366:16586\">\n        <div className=\"absolute bg-[#48352d] h-[48px] left-[30px] rounded-[100px] top-[585px] w-[330px]\" data-node-id=\"366:16587\" />\n      </a>\n      <p className=\"[word-break:break-word] absolute font-['Helvetica:Regular'] leading-[normal] left-[128.5px] not-italic text-[16px] text-white top-[599px] whitespace-nowrap\" data-node-id=\"366:16588\">\n        отправить адрес\n      </p>\n      <p className=\"[word-break:break-word] absolute font-['Helvetica:Regular'] leading-[normal] left-[30px] not-italic text-[#808080] text-[12px] top-[111px] w-[332px]\" data-node-id=\"366:16589\">\n        Укажи расположение торговой точки вручную.\n      </p>\n      <button className=\"absolute bg-[rgba(255,255,255,0)] block cursor-pointer left-[18px] size-[42px] top-[53px]\" data-node-id=\"366:16592\" data-name=\"PROTO / Назад\">\n        <p className=\"[word-break:break-word] absolute font-['Helvetica:Bold'] leading-[normal] left-[12px] not-italic text-[30px] text-black text-left top-0 whitespace-nowrap\" data-node-id=\"366:16593\">\n          ‹\n        </p>\n      </button>\n      <NavStores className=\"absolute bg-white h-[60px] left-0 top-[640px] w-[390px]\" />\n      <div className=\"absolute bg-[rgba(255,255,255,0)] h-[60px] left-[8px] top-[640px] w-[110px]\" data-node-id=\"366:16595\" data-name=\"NAV / Магазины\" />\n      <div className=\"absolute bg-[rgba(255,255,255,0)] h-[60px] left-[125px] top-[640px] w-[110px]\" data-node-id=\"366:16596\" data-name=\"NAV / Камера\" />\n      <div className=\"absolute bg-[rgba(255,255,255,0)] h-[60px] left-[242px] top-[640px] w-[110px]\" data-node-id=\"366:16597\" data-name=\"NAV / Профиль\" />\n      <a className=\"absolute bg-[rgba(255,255,255,0)] block cursor-pointer h-[60px] left-0 top-[640px] w-[130px]\" data-node-id=\"379:495\" data-name=\"FLOW / Низ / Магазин\" />\n      <a className=\"absolute bg-[rgba(255,255,255,0)] block cursor-pointer h-[60px] left-[130px] top-[640px] w-[130px]\" data-node-id=\"379:497\" data-name=\"FLOW / Низ / Камера\" />\n      <a className=\"absolute bg-[rgba(255,255,255,0)] block cursor-pointer h-[60px] left-[260px] top-[640px] w-[130px]\" data-node-id=\"379:499\" data-name=\"FLOW / Низ / Профиль\" />\n    </div>\n  );\n}"},{"type":"text","text":"SUPER CRITICAL: The generated React+Tailwind code MUST be converted to match the target project's technology stack and styling system.\n1. Analyze the target codebase to identify: technology stack, styling approach, component patterns, and design tokens\n2. Convert React syntax to the target framework/library\n3. Transform all Tailwind classes to the target styling system while preserving exact visual design\n4. Follow the project's existing patterns and conventions\nDO NOT install any Tailwind as a dependency unless the user instructs you to do so.\n"},{"type":"text","text":"Node ids have been added to the code as data attributes, e.g. `data-node-id=\"1:2\"`."},{"type":"text","text":"These styles are contained in the design: white: #FFFFFF, black: #000000, helvetica bold 16 0%: Font(family: \"Helvetica\", style: Bold, size: 16, weight: 700, lineHeight: 100, letterSpacing: 0), gray 2: #A5A5A5, brown: #48352D, beige: #F0EFEB."},{"type":"text","text":"The generated code contains image and SVG URL constants, e.g. const image = `${assetPathPrefix}/<asset file name>`, where assetPathPrefix is declared once at the top of the code and every asset URL interpolates it. These URLs are temporary download sources and expire after 7 days. Download each asset into the project with curl -L, then replace its URL in the generated code with a reference to the downloaded asset. Never use the temporary URLs as runtime image sources."},{"type":"image","data":"","mimeType":"image/png"}],"structuredContent":null,"isError":false}
